#: ../../../api/conditional_formats.md:1
msgid "Add a two- or three-color scale."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/conditional_formats.md:3
msgid ""
"`colors` contains two or three colors ordered from the minimum to the "
"maximum. Without `thresholds`, a two-color scale uses the lowest and highest "
"values, while a three-color scale adds the 50th percentile as its midpoint. "
"Custom thresholds must match the number of colors and be strictly "
"increasing. `threshold_type` can be `\"number\"`, `\"percent\"` or "
"`\"percentile\"`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/conditional_formats.md:1
msgid "Add a custom-formula rule."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/conditional_formats.md:1
msgid "Add a data bar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/conditional_formats.md:3
msgid ""
"Omitted bounds are automatic. Supplied bounds use `threshold_type`, which "
"can be `\"number\"`, `\"percent\"` or `\"percentile\"`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/conditional_formats.md:1
msgid "Add a built-in icon set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/conditional_formats.md:3
msgid ""
"Custom thresholds contain one fewer value than the number of icons and must "
"be strictly increasing. Without them, the icons use equal percent bands (for "
"example, 33 and 67 for a three-icon set)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/conditional_formats.md:7
msgid ""
"Valid styles are `\"3_arrows\"`, `\"3_arrows_gray\"`, `\"3_flags\"`, "
"`\"3_traffic_lights_1\"`, `\"3_traffic_lights_2\"`, `\"3_signs\"`, "
"`\"3_symbols\"`, `\"3_symbols_2\"`, `\"4_arrows\"`, `\"4_arrows_gray\"`, "
"`\"4_red_to_black\"`, `\"4_rating\"`, `\"4_traffic_lights\"`, "
"`\"5_arrows\"`, `\"5_arrows_gray\"`, `\"5_rating\"`, `\"5_quarters\"`, "
"`\"3_stars\"`, `\"3_triangles\"` and `\"5_boxes\"`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/conditional_formats.md:1
msgid "Clear all conditional formats active on the represented range."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/conditional_formats.md:3
msgid "Rules that also apply outside the range remain active there."
msgstr ""
